sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Admin as Admin / Argo CD
    participant API as kube-apiserver<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OLM as OLM + Catalogs<br/>50051/TCP gRPC
    participant RHODS as rhods-operator
    participant Client as Client
    participant MaaS as maas-default-gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GridGW as grid-gateway<br/>443 to 8443/TCP TLS
    participant Peer as Peer grid-provider-gateway<br/>Route 443 to 8080 mTLS
    participant KServe as openshift-ai-inference<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ACMC as ACM metrics-collector
    participant Coll as RHOAI OTel collector<br/>8890/TCP HTTP
    participant HubLoki as Hub Loki gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as NooBaa S3<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant XAPI as XKS kube-apiserver<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant CM as cloud-manager-operator
    participant Hook as post-install hook Job<br/>ose-cli
    participant IGW as inference-gateway Istio<br/>80/TCP + 443/TCP

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
    Note over Admin,RHODS: Flow 1 - OpenShift install via Helm / Argo CD
    Admin->>API: helm install (Subscriptions)<br/>TLS 1.2+, cluster-admin token
    Admin->>API: Helm lookup: CRD exists?<br/>TLS 1.2+
    API-->>Admin: CRDs missing - render Subscriptions only
    OLM->>OLM: Resolve catalog to CSVs<br/>gRPC 50051, no TLS (in-cluster)
    OLM->>API: Install operators + CRDs
    Admin->>API: helm upgrade / Argo resync<br/>DSCI, DSC, Kuadrant, Authorino, Gateways
    RHODS->>API: Reconcile components per DSC<br/>operator SA, TLS 1.2+
    end

    rect rgb(240, 230, 255)
    Note over Client,KServe: Flow 2 - AI Grid cross-site inference
    Client->>MaaS: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>TLS, Bearer (Authorino/Kuadrant)
    MaaS->>GridGW: Forward 443 to 8443<br/>TLS service-ca, Authorization stripped
    GridGW->>Peer: Route by X-Gateway-Model-Name<br/>mTLS Grid CA ECDSA P-256, named SPIFFE cert
    Peer->>KServe: Allowlisted path<br/>TLS service-ca trust, Bearer grid-model-client-token
    KServe-->>Peer: Inference response
    Peer-->>GridGW: Response (mTLS)
    GridGW-->>MaaS: Response
    MaaS-->>Client: JSON response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 225)
    Note over ACMC,S3: Flow 3 - AI Grid observability (spoke to hub)
    ACMC->>Coll: GET /metrics 8890/TCP<br/>HTTP plaintext, no auth (NetworkPolicy only)
    Coll->>HubLoki: OTLP /api/logs/v1/infrastructure/otlp<br/>TLS, Bearer hub-usage-logs-auth
    HubLoki->>S3: Store chunks<br/>TLS service-ca, S3 keys
    end

    rect rgb(225, 250, 240)
    Note over Admin,IGW: Flow 4 - XKS install (AKS / EKS / CoreWeave)
    Admin->>XAPI: helm install rhai-on-xks-chart<br/>CRDs, operators, RBAC, rhai-pull-secret (TLS, cluster-admin)
    CM->>XAPI: Install cert-manager, Gateway API, Sail, LWS, RHCL<br/>issue rhai-operator webhook cert (cloud-manager SA)
    Hook->>XAPI: Wait for CRDs/CA/GatewayClass (max 300 s)<br/>create Kserve, KubernetesEngine CRs, rhai-ca-bundle, inference-gateway
    Client->>IGW: Inference request<br/>HTTP 80 plaintext or HTTPS 443 TLS (rhai-ca-issuer cert)
    end
